{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Can you draw Leviathan</b> — missing the interrogative heh." "<b>With a hook</b> — with a net." "<b>Will you sink down</b> — related to the root of 'ותשקט האש' ('and the fire subsided')."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {0 "The form תמשוך lacks the expected prefixed heh of the interrogative; Ibn Ezra notes the deficiency.", 2 "The comparison is between תשקיע and the root of ותשקט (ש-ק-ט / ש-ק-ע); the precise root affiliation is left unstated by Ibn Ezra."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:32.806998790Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}